# The 64 MB Temporal time-skipping test server, downloaded on a cold cache by
# the Temporal example's suite. Pinned here rather than left in the OS temp
# directory so it survives across runs and is a stable path CI can cache.
# See examples/order-temporal/README.md.
.cache/
